WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.430
"It's a nice sunny day," Rex said.

2
00:00:08.431 --> 00:00:11.434
"Let's play something!"

3
00:00:11.435 --> 00:00:15.030
"What can we play?" Sara asked.

4
00:00:15.038 --> 00:00:19.070
"I want to play something fun," Sid said.

5
00:00:19.071 --> 00:00:22.188
"Silly Sid!" Rex said.

6
00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:27.101
"Playing is always fun!"

7
00:00:27.102 --> 00:00:31.598
"Let's race!" Tor said.

8
00:00:31.599 --> 00:00:33.804
Tor ran to a tree.

9
00:00:33.805 --> 00:00:38.234
Then she ran back.

10
00:00:38.235 --> 00:00:41.737
"Wow!" Sara said.

11
00:00:41.738 --> 00:00:45.624
"You're fast, Tor!"

12
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.915
Sid frowned.

13
00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:51.474
"I'm slow," he said.

14
00:00:51.475 --> 00:00:55.635
"Racing is not fun for me."

15
00:00:55.636 --> 00:01:00.549
"We can play hide-and-seek," Sara said.

16
00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:06.153
"I'm not good at hiding," Sid said.

17
00:01:06.154 --> 00:01:10.354
"Hmm." Rex tapped his foot.

18
00:01:10.355 --> 00:01:17.330
"What can we play?"

19
00:01:17.331 --> 00:01:20.959
Suddenly Rex remembered something.

20
00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:28.867
"I saw dinos jumping vines yesterday.

21
00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:31.858
Let's try that."

22
00:01:31.859 --> 00:01:38.376
"Oh!" Sara said. "Fun!"

23
00:01:38.377 --> 00:01:42.989
Sid shrugged. "That might be fun."

24
00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:47.299
"Great!" Rex said.

25
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.829
Then he scratched his head.

26
00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:57.516
"Where did Tor go?"

